  "explanation": "Both answers are directly supported by the original sources. D1S10 explicitly states that Uhldingen-Mühlhofen 'joined the company's ranks, becoming one of its valued member municipalities' referring to KIRU. D2S2 states that Uhldingen-Mühlhofen 'has become the first European member of the prestigious SGCNZ Young Shakespeare Company.' Both claims refer to Uhldingen-Mühlhofen as a member of these organizations, and there is no evidence of contradiction between the two claims since they refer to distinct entities (a technology provider and a theater company)."
